{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791600/extras/9a4c6b78283593de5418dc7e332f9b61.avif?t=1756321315\" width=1008 height=248 /></span><strong>Simple Rules, Deep Logic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill circular puzzles with the correct numbers using just three simple rules. Rondoku is a calm and minimalist logic game that invites you to slow down, think carefully, and find satisfaction in clever solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791600/extras/rondoku_steam_gif_diagram.png?t=1756321315\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>70 Hand-Crafted Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle in Rondoku is designed by hand. With 70 unique levels, the game offers a thoughtful difficulty curve and a sense of intention in every diagram.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Puzzle Book</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic puzzle magazines, Rondoku is presented as a book. Flip through its pages freely and enjoy the quiet satisfaction of solving each puzzle, one by one, until the book is complete.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3791600?t=1756321315","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791600/ce17fc2bff9ac96d91d7fecae41f71b126913dc3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756321315","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791600/a1df5ed91231d1ca6fcdcd0728382f1b1fbe68a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756321315","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791600/a1df5ed91231d1ca6fcdcd0728382f1b1fbe68a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756321315","categories":[{"descrip